{"unit_id":"hZsFN__dsh-default-model-lock#card-zh","repo":"hZsFN/dsh-default-model-lock","commit":"de5bc832a8a9a5a4db4743c26129af6b50e6b474","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-lock 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的默认模型管理插件。它在设置页提供共享默认模型锁定开关，通过包装 agentDefaultModel 服务的 currentSelection 与 saveSelection，让新会话等读取锁定的 provider、model 和可选推理档位，同时阻止会话模型选择覆盖共享默认值。设置页从实时模型目录列出有效选项，并按版本检查后保存。还可独立管理 mnemon 任务代理模型，将固定路由镜像到 mnemon 配置，并在配置读取时保持该路由。适合希望聊天模型切换不影响新会话及后台默认模型的 DSH 用户；不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:24-30","core.mjs:123-149","lib/client.js:253-459","lib/client.js:700-730"]}
{"unit_id":"hZsFN__dsh-default-model-lock#card-en","repo":"hZsFN/dsh-default-model-lock","commit":"de5bc832a8a9a5a4db4743c26129af6b50e6b474","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-lock pins DSH's shared default model from a Web settings page. New sessions keep the chosen provider, model, and reasoning effort when chat choices change. The page validates choices against the live catalog. An optional setting pins mnemon's task-agent model. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:24-30","core.mjs:123-149","lib/client.js:253-459","lib/client.js:700-730"]}
