{"unit_id":"hZsFN__dsh-default-model-lock#feature-1","repo":"hZsFN/dsh-default-model-lock","commit":"de5bc832a8a9a5a4db4743c26129af6b50e6b474","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-lock 的功能「固定共享默认模型」：启用后，新会话等读取指定的 provider、model 和可选推理档位；会话选择器保存默认值时不会改写共享选择。用户在设置页选择并保存锁定值。","source":"generated","evidence":["core.mjs:123-149","lib/client.js:193-216"]}
{"unit_id":"hZsFN__dsh-default-model-lock#feature-2","repo":"hZsFN/dsh-default-model-lock","commit":"de5bc832a8a9a5a4db4743c26129af6b50e6b474","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-lock 的功能「模型目录校验」：设置页读取实时 provider、模型与推理档位目录，只提供存在的选项；目录未就绪或已保存值失效时显示状态，不自动猜测或替换模型。启用锁定时保存会校验选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:125-141","lib/client.js:193-216","lib/client.js:347-356"]}
{"unit_id":"hZsFN__dsh-default-model-lock#feature-3","repo":"hZsFN/dsh-default-model-lock","commit":"de5bc832a8a9a5a4db4743c26129af6b50e6b474","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-lock 的功能「mnemon 任务代理路由」：在设置页可独立启用固定 provider 和 model，保存后同步到 mnemon 配置；读取 mnemon 配置时也会将任务代理路由维持为所选值。","source":"generated","evidence":["core.mjs:31-39","core.mjs:50-73","core.mjs:84-117"]}
{"unit_id":"hZsFN__dsh-default-model-lock#caveat-1","repo":"hZsFN/dsh-default-model-lock","commit":"de5bc832a8a9a5a4db4743c26129af6b50e6b474","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-lock 使用前须知：启用 mnemon 接管后，插件会通过 configEditor 将固定路由写入 mnemon 插件配置；关闭接管不会回滚该路由。（见 core.mjs:84-105）","source":"generated","evidence":["core.mjs:84-105"]}
